OL,3,ATemperatures could climb to 28C in late
OL,4,Aburst of warmth
OL,5,
OL,6,FTemperatures could touch 28C (82F) in
OL,7,Fparts of the UK on Sunday as
OL,8,Fsummer-like warmth makes a brief
OL,9,Freturn.
OL,11,FA southerly wind will draw in a shot of
OL,12,Fhot and humid air from the near
OL,13,Fcontinent, pushing UK temperatures
OL,14,Fabove average.
OL,16,FThe hottest locations in south-east
OL,17,FEngland could reach 27 or 28C (82F),
OL,18,Fwhile England and Wales more widely
OL,19,Fwill see temperatures in the mid-20s
OL,20,FCelsius.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
